Name: Intel oneVPL dispatcher
Short Name: libvpl
URL: https://github.com/intel/libvpl
Version: 2.17.0
Revision: d77f9195cf495b937631607333288fd917ae8939
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Windows x64 dispatcher and API headers. No GPU runtime is redistributed.

Local Modifications:
BUILD.gn and libvpl-manifest.json only. The manifest records the SHA256 of
each unmodified vendored source/header/license file. Hashes freeze the
reviewed S7 cache; they are not independent upstream release authentication.
The dispatcher uses Chromium's toolchain, libc++ and CRT, with exceptions
enabled only for its target. No driver DLLs or prebuilt libraries are vendored.
